  "identifier": "ggseg.extra",
  "description": "Create brain atlas data sets compatible with the 'ggsegverse' plotting packages. Provides pipelines for building cortical, subcortical, white-matter tract, and cerebellar atlases from 'FreeSurfer' annotation files, 'GIFTI' and 'CIFTI' surface formats, 'neuromaps', cerebellar flatmaps, and volumetric 'NIfTI' images.",
